{"id":"5ea5b4fccf12f679","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-satisfiable.md","title":"可满足","display":"df-satisfiable — 可满足","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-satisfiable","aliases":["29-df-satisfiable"],"display":"df-satisfiable — 可满足","depends_on":["[[29-df-structure]]","[[29-df-struc]]","[[29-df-sentence]]","[[29-df-truth]]"],"source_locator":"Theorem 1.35 and following discussion, p.22, DjVu scan 37","source_basis":"原书陈述核对及本地语义修订；证明范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-satisfiable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-satisfiable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-satisfiable — 可满足"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0ac4b9a122d458e2\" href=\"?note=0ac4b9a122d458e2\" title=\"29-df-structure\">29-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"711217f22972ffc0\" href=\"?note=711217f22972ffc0\" title=\"29-df-sentence\">29-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"754d9a003ca52ced\" href=\"?note=754d9a003ca52ced\" title=\"29-df-truth\">29-df-truth</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 1.35 and following discussion, p.22, DjVu scan 37"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"原书陈述核对及本地语义修订；证明范围见 Remark"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-satisfiable-—-可满足-Sat\">df-satisfiable — 可满足 Sat</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为有限词汇；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}[S]\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}[S]\\)</span> 为任意非空模型类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{STRUC}[S]\">\\(\\mathrm{STRUC}[S]\\)</span> 为有限模型类，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0ac4b9a122d458e2\" href=\"?note=0ac4b9a122d458e2\" title=\"29-df-structure\">29-df-structure</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a>。</li>\n<li>闭句满足见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"754d9a003ca52ced\" href=\"?note=754d9a003ca52ced\" title=\"29-df-truth\">29-df-truth</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_S(\\Phi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}[S]\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\;(A\\models\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sat}_S(\\Phi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}[S]\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\;(A\\models\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinSat}_S(\\Phi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[S]\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\;(A\\models\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FinSat}_S(\\Phi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[S]\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\;(A\\models\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}(\\Phi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sat}_S(\\Phi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sat}(\\Phi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sat}_S(\\Phi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 1.35 及其后说明，印刷页 22、扫描页 37。旧定义把 Sat 限定为有限模型，却把普通紧致性应用于它，导致错误结论。本次显式分出有限可满足性，不再用同一个谓词混淆两个模型论域。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-satisfiable-—-可满足-Sat","text":"df-satisfiable — 可满足 Sat","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"0ac4b9a122d458e2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"711217f22972ffc0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-truth","status":"resolved","id":"754d9a003ca52ced","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"0ac4b9a122d458e2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}[S]$ 为任意非空模型类，$\\mathrm{STRUC}[S]$ 为有限模型类，见 [[29-df-structure]]、[[29-df-struc]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}[S]$ 为任意非空模型类，$\\mathrm{STRUC}[S]$ 为有限模型类，见 [[29-df-structure]]、[[29-df-struc]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-truth","status":"resolved","id":"754d9a003ca52ced","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"闭句满足见 [[29-df-truth]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}[S]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{STRUC}[S]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sat}_S(\\Phi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}[S]\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\;(A\\models\\varphi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinSat}_S(\\Phi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[S]\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\;(A\\models\\varphi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sat}(\\Phi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sat}_S(\\Phi).","display":true}],"bytes":1317,"backlinks":[{"id":"e21d9ae53890ee4c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$x_1,\\ldots,x_m$ 为不同变量名；$\\mathrm{Sat}_S,\\mathrm{FinSat}_S$ 见 [[29-df-satisfiable]]。"},{"id":"6d4131ca1202619d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sat}_\\tau$ 与 $\\models_\\tau$ 分别取任意非空结构上的可满足性和后承，见 [[29-df-satisfiable]]、[[29-df-logical-consequence]]；不取有限模型专用版本。"},{"id":"68b137f6e323ad19","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sat}_S$ 允许无限模型，见 [[29-df-satisfiable]]；不使用 $\\mathrm{FinSat}_S$。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-123","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-satisfiable]]"}],"outgoing":["0ac4b9a122d458e2","4de8e0c8085801f5","711217f22972ffc0","754d9a003ca52ced"]}